<div id="divRequestForm" class="form expand-form">
    <p>- Instant Data tab: displays the number of concurrent users recorded at the moment.</p>    
    <p>- Hourly Report tab: displays the largest number of concurrent users recorded among any 10-minute periods of every hour in a single day.</p>
    <p>- Daily Report tab: displays the largest number of concurrent users recorded among any 10-minute periods of every day in a selected date range.</p>
</div>